<div class="item-page" >
<meta itemprop="inLanguage" content="en-GB" />
<div itemprop="articleBody">
<h1>Our Programs</h1>
<p align="justify">The PGDM program at IIMS take a long-term view of business education and prepare students for long and fulfilling careers. Our multi-disciplinary, application based curriculum provides life skills and practical knowledge that allows us to create innovators, thought-leaders, and entrepreneurs who can reinvent the future of doing business in new ways. Through these programs, we enable our students to become business ready and to lead from the day they step into industry.</p>
<div class="simpletabwrap courceswrap">
<div class="tabArea">
<ul>
<li> <a href="#." class="tab activeTab" id="list" onclick="javascript:show_next('list')">PGDM</a> </li>
<li> <a href="#." class="tab" id="details" onclick="javascript:show_next('details')">PGDM(Retail & E-Com)</a> </li>
<!--  <li> <a href="#." class="tab" id="pgdba" onclick="javascript:show_next('pgdba')">PGDBA</a> </li> -->
<li> <a href="#." class="tab" id="added" onclick="javascript:show_next('added')">Value Added Inputs</a> </li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="tabMain">
<div id="list_data" class="contentArea">
<h3>Program name : Post Graduate Diploma in Management</h3>
<h3>Duration : 2 Years</h3>
<h3>Approved by AICTE</h3>
<br />
<p>The PGDM program of IIMS incorporates the contemporary academic and practical concepts and seeks to train students to become decision makers, visionaries, and capable of assuming higher corporate responsibility. The program involves classroom teaching, case discussions, hands-on management internship in industry and project work.</p>
<h3>Overview</h3>
<p>Post Graduate Diploma in Management (PGDM) is a two years, full time program, which is approved by AICTE, Ministry of HRD, Govt. of India. The program gives IB i.e International Business as super specialization. The PGDM Program at IIMS offers 45 days Winter Internship and 90 days Summer Internship along with 200 hours of live project.<br /> The Institute offers certification programs in SAP R3, Digital Marketing, Six Sigma, Foreign Language and Business Analytics.</p>
<h3>Super Specializations offered</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>International Business</li>
</ul>
<h3>Major Specializations offered</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>Marketing</li>
<li>Finance</li>
<li>Human Resource</li>
<li>Supply Chain Management</li>
<li>Business Analytics</li>
</ul>
<h3>Minor Specializations offered</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>Marketing</li>
<li>Finance</li>
<li>Human Resource</li>
<li>Supply Chain Management</li>
<li>Business Analytics</li>
<li>Agri Business Management</li>
</ul>
<h3>List of Subjects - Sem I - Cluster - I</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>Organization Behaviour</li>
<li>Principles and Practices of Management / General Management</li>
<li>Corporate Social Responsibilities (CSR)</li>
<li>Principles of Accountings</li>
<li>Principles of  Marketing</li>
<li>Managerial Economics</li>
<li>Digital Business Management</li>
<li>Statistics and Quantitative Techniques</li>
</ul>
<h3>List of Subjects - Sem I - Cluster - II</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>Foreign Language</li>
<li>International Business I</li>

For more details <a href="/images/pdf/IIMS-sem1-subject-list-2022-24.pdf" target="_blank"> <strong>click here </strong></a>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="details_data" class="contentArea" style="display: none;">
<div class="starwrap">
<table>
<caption>  Program Name :  Post Graduate Diploma in Management (Retail & E-Com)    </caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th width="25%" scope="col">Corporate Connect</th>
<th width="25%" scope="col">Winter & Summer Internship</th>
<th width="25%" scope="col">Live Projects</th>
<th width="25%" scope="col">International Immersion Program</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td aria-label="Name" colspan="2"><b>Duration : 2 Years</b></td>
<td aria-label="Year" colspan="2"><b>Approved by AICTE </b></td>
</tr>
<tr><td aria-label="Name" colspan="4"><b>Few of our Key Recruiters</b></td> </tr>
<tr>
<td aria-label="Name" ><img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="/images/our-recruiters/bose.png" class="jch-lazyload" alt="Bose" </img width="200" height="100" /><noscript><img src="/images/our-recruiters/bose.png" alt="Bose" </img width="200" height="100" /></noscript></td>
<td aria-label="Name" ><img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="/images/our-recruiters/shoper-stop.png" class="jch-lazyload" alt="Shopper'sStop" </img width="200" height="100" /><noscript><img src="/images/our-recruiters/shoper-stop.png" alt="Shopper'sStop" </img width="200" height="100" /></noscript></td>
<td aria-label="Name" ><img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="/images/our-recruiters/Reliance.png" class="jch-lazyload" alt="Reliance" </img width="124" height="66" /><noscript><img src="/images/our-recruiters/Reliance.png" alt="Reliance" </img width="124" height="66" /></noscript></td>
<td aria-label="Name" ><img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="/images/our-recruiters/aditya-birla.png" class="jch-lazyload" alt="AdityaBirla" </img width="134" height="101" /><noscript><img src="/images/our-recruiters/aditya-birla.png" alt="AdityaBirla" </img width="134" height="101" /></noscript></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<br/>
<p align="justify">Retail Marketing presents a plethora of global job opportunities. Join for specializing in domestic and global retail marketing expertise</p>
<h3>Overview</h3>
<p align="justify">Globally retail e-commerce is growing phenomenally. Our PGDM in Retail & E-Commerce is focused on catering to the vibrant and emergent retail industry. You get not only the best academic inputs but also opportunity for live internship projects with prestigious organizations like Future Group, Aditya Birla, Reliance Retail, Pantaloons, Shoppers Stop etc.</p>
<h3>Eligibility</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li> You should have a minimum of 50% in your graduation examination.</li>
<li> You are required to clear the Admission Process at IIMS, Pune</li>
<li> You should have qualified for at least one of the entrance exams as per AICTE guidelines.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Advantage of Retail</h3>
<p align="justify">India is a marketplace with great potential. Globalization has led to many huge international brands entering Indian Retail scenario and hence as retail professional you get the opportunity to work with these big brands, get lucrative salary packages and global exposure. </p>
<p align="justify">Career options that you have on completion of PGDM (Retail & E-Commerce) are varied. You are presented with choices of taking up varied profiles like Retail Manager, Store Manager, Department Manager, Merchandising Manager, Retail Operations Manager, Retail Marketing Manager etc. To successfully cope with the challenges of the retail sector along with making the students fundamentals strong through classroom learning we also ensure practical exposure of the students.</p>
<p align="justify">Our PGDM (Retail & E-Commerce) is framed in a manner so as to cater to the dynamic retail sector. The focus of our course is on both, the domestic as well as the global brands. Also the course has its focus on the role of E-Commerce in retail. </p>
<h3>PGDM (Retail & E-Commerce) – Significant Elements</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>2 years (Full-time) program which is AICTE Approved.</li>
<li>International Immersion Program – International Study Tour.</li>
<li>Concentrated Internship of 5 months with eminent Retail Brands like Future Group, Aditya Birla, Reliance Retail, Pantaloons, Shoppers Stop etc., which enables practical exposure and on-the-job training.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Why PGDM (Retail & E-Commerce) at IIMS, Pune?</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>Retail Marketing & E-Commerce as a career is on the rise. The rise in FMCG brands and increased presence of global brands are creating fantastic job opportunities.</li>
<li>India being a high potential market and expected to continue growing will create great career potential in Retail Marketing & E-Commerce.</li>
<li>The retail market has a challenging atmosphere and is a vibrant and lively sector to work with.</li>
<li>Lucrative Salary Package.</li>
</ul>
<p align="justify">The Post Graduate Diploma in Management (Retail & E-Commerce) offers dual specialization to the students with the super specialization in Retail Management. This combination ensures that the student gets the complete basket of skills required to succeed this growing and evolving sector. </p>
<p align="justify">The syllabus of PGDM (Retail & E-Commerce) has an assortment of subjects which encompass the central elements of Retail & E-Commerce Management. 
 </p>
<h3>Subjects in brief</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>Principles of Marketing</li>
<li>Organizational Behavior</li>
<li>Managerial Economics</li>
<li>Business Market Research</li>
<li>Business Communication</li>
<li>Managerial Accounting & Finance</li>
<li>Digital Business</li>
<li>Digital Marketing</li>
<li>Retail Management</li>
<li>Retail Operations</li>
<li>Inventory Management</li>
<li>Logistics & Supply Chain Management</li>
<li>IT in Retail</li>
<li>International Retailing</li>
</ul>
<p align="justify">Our expert and skilled faculty make use of modern and novel methods of teaching. Workshops, Certifications, Live Projects, Internships, and Industry Interaction helps our students gain the expertise to carve a niche for themselves.
<p align="justify"></p> 
Candidates who are interested can apply online or visit our campus. You can also interact with our counselors regarding the admission process. Connect with us online or through the links given.</p>
<p align="justify">
It is said that, the ideal path for the creation of your future is to invent your future. Joining PGDM (Retail & E-Commerce) at IIMS, Pune will be your initial move towards the invention of the future that you envisage for yourself. 
 </p>
</div>
