<div id="added_data" class="contentArea" style="display: none;">
<p>Following value added Inputs are designed and developed based on the HR expectations. We strongly believe that the students who are exposed to these inputs get the 360 degree development which helps them in getting good start in their professional journey..</p>
<h3>Teaching Methodology and Pedagogy</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>Case Study based Learning</li>
<li>Project Based Learning</li>
</ul>
<h3>Personality Development programs</h3>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>Finishing School program by International Trainers</li>
<li>Self SWOT</li>
<li>Management / Presentation Skills</li>
<li>Pre-Placement Training</li>
<li>English Communication Classes</li>
<li>Resume Building</li>
</ul>
<h3>Certifications and Training Offered</h3>
<p>Alongwith regular courses, following certifications are offered to the students.</p>
<ul class="listStyle">
<li>SPSS</li>
<li>SAP</li>
<li>Digital Marketing</li>
<li>Foreign Language</li>
<li>Business Analytics</li>
<li>Financial Modeling</li>
<li>Marketing Analytics</li>
</ul>
</div>
